OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric cathedral introduces #12
OL,4,Afee for visitors from outside Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors from outside Scotland now need
OL,7,Fto pay to enter one of Edinburgh's most
OL,8,Fpopular attractions for the first time
OL,9,Fin its 900-year history.
OL,11,FGeneral admission to St Giles'
OL,12,FCathedral is set at #12, while free
OL,13,Fentry is still offered to Scottish
OL,14,Fresidents and under-16s.
OL,16,FScottish visitors can get into the
OL,17,Fhistoric cathedral for free by
OL,18,Fregistering online and providing proof
OL,19,Fof residency, while visitors who live
OL,20,Felsewhere in the UK or abroad will need
OL,21,Fto pay for tickets.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
